    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis charming terraced house, ideally situated in the heart of Shanballymore village, offers a wonderful opportunity to acquire a home with genuine character, excellent village amenities and enormous potential for further development.\n\nThe property enjoys a fantastic location, with everyday amenities conveniently close by, including the local school, church, pub and GAA pitch. Its central village setting makes this an ideal choice for those seeking a relaxed community lifestyle while remaining within easy reach of surrounding towns and services.\n\nThe accommodation currently comprises three bedrooms, providing comfortable family living, while the property also offers plenty of scope for modernisation and personalisation to suit individual tastes and requirements.\n\nOne of the property's most appealing features is its exceptionally spacious rear garden. The garden also offers ample room for family entertaining, gardening or simply enjoying the outdoors.\n\nThe area has an abundance of activies to choose from such as kayaying on the nearby Blackwater, hiking or mountain biking in the surrounding Ballyhouras and also Annesgrove Gardens together with Doneraile Park in close proximity. \nLocated less than 6km from Killdorrery, a 20 minute drive from both Mallow and Fermoy town.\n\nA viewing of this property comes highly recommended and by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorche - 0.97m x 1.80m\nLino Flooring\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.26m x 0.9m\nLino Flooring.\n\nBathroom - 1.64m x 0.9m\nFully tiled with Whb And toilet. Shower unit with electric shower.\n\nLiving Room - 2.65m x 4.46m\nLino flooring, solid fuel fire with brick surround.\n\nKitchen - 4.14m x 2.96m\nLino Flooring. Fully fitted kitchen.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.3m x 3.0m\nLino flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.7m x 3.7m\nLino flooring\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.3m x 2.6m\nCarpet flooring\n\n"
      },
      {
